# Anything under agents/private/ stays on your machine. That's where the
# study library lives — notes, guidelines, anything with a patient or a
# person in it has no business in a repository, least of all one whose
# CI job pushes commits back. Only the explainer is tracked.
agents/private/*
!agents/private/README.md

# Same again for the notebook: your PDFs, the text pulled out of them,
# the vectors, your notes and anything exported. A research library is
# other people's copyrighted papers and your own unpublished work, and
# neither belongs in a repository whose CI pushes commits back.
notebook/private/*
!notebook/private/README.md
